'''Costabella Airport''' ({{lang|ca|Aeroport de Costabella}}; [[IATA airport code|IATA]]: CBL, [[ICAO airport code|ICAO]]: CBIB) is a domestic airport serving [[Costabella]], a coastal city in [[Nurra Province]], [[Balboa]], on the [[Aethiopian Ocean]] coast. The airport is turboprop-only, with no jet-capable runway. It is served by [[Aeroístmus]] from [[Sant Cristòfor International Airport|Sant Cristòfor]] and by [[RapidAir (Balboa)|RapidAir]] turboprop services.

